# RightHand — Cross-harness capability pointer

Use portable capabilities from `skills/<capability>/SKILL.md`.

Full orchestration behavior (tickets, worktree lanes, dispatch) is documented in the repo's `README.md` and `mods/righthand.ts`.  
`/righthand` interactive switch is available only in Command Code mod runtime.

For install details, see `GUIDE.md`.